  "content": {
    "title": "中心党总支召开党员大会落实意识形态安全工作",
    "source": "中心党总支",
    "publishDate": "2020-03-26",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: large; font-weight: bold; font-family: 宋体;\">2020年3月26日，为更加全面学习理解领会十九大报告中提到的意识形态安全问题，按照</span></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);><span style=\"text-align: justify; font-weight: bold; font-size: large; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"text-align: left;\">中心党总支2020年工作方案，</span>吉林省高等学校毕业生就业指导中心党总支组织全体党员开展“<spanyes';font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\">充分认识做好</spanyes';font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold; display:none;mso-hide:all;font-size:22.0000pt;=\"\" mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\">识形态工作是一项极端重要的工作”专题辅导，进行意识形态安全教育，落实意识形态安全工作。中心党总支书记唐洪丰同志主讲，全体党员和积极分了参加。</spanyes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;></span></span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"assets/d81594a7b13a0b87efec108a5b260825e901ff627b4226a6708a7a2774a5e99c.png\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><b style=\"\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold; display:none;mso-hide:all;font-size:22.0000pt;=\"\" mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-size: large; font-family: 宋体;\">&nbsp; 唐洪丰同志紧紧围绕十九大报告中意识形态安全的内容，从意识</spanyes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;></b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: large; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; text-indent: 32pt;\">形态工作的意义与目的、我国意识形态安全存在的隐忧、</span><spanyes';font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: large; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; text-indent: 32pt;\">如何做好意识形态工作三个方面讲解意识形态工作的极端重要性。</spanyes';font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: large; font-weight: bold; text-align: left;\">&nbsp; 他强调，在事关国家发展的大事上，大家都不能做旁观者，要高度重视，尽职尽责，积极参与，紧密配合，共同开创宣传思想工作新局面。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"assets/2100820146657d94580579eb2fe0768d83dc584f660d4ae9c8a0e2324ad1ce52.png\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: large; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; text-indent: 32pt;\">&nbsp; 他要求，全体党员干部要不断提高政治站位，树牢“四个意识”、坚定“四个自信”、做到“两个维护”，迅速掀起学习宣传贯彻四中全会精神的热潮。全体党员要结合工作实际，以实际行动践行党的十九届四中全会精神，推动中心工作高质量发展。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><spanyes';font-family:calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体; mso-bidi-font-family:'times=\"\" new=\"\" roman';font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;></p><style>\n@font-face{\nfont-family:\"Times New Roman\";\n}\n\n@font-face{\nfont-family:\"宋体\";\n}\n\n@font-face{\nfont-family:\"Calibri\";\n}\n\np.MsoNormal{\nmso-style-name:正文;\nmso-style-parent:\"\";\nmargin:0pt;\nmargin-bottom:.0001pt;\nmso-pagination:none;\ntext-align:justify;\ntext-justify:inter-ideograph;\nfont-family:Calibri;\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;\nmso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';\nfont-size:10.5000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\n}\n\nspan.10{\nfont-family:Calibri;\n}\n\nspan.15{\nfont-family:Calibri;\nfont-weight:bold;\n}\n\np.p{\nmso-style-name:\"普通\\(网站\\)\";\nmso-margin-top-alt:auto;\nmso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nmso-pagination:none;\ntext-align:left;\nfont-family:Calibri;\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;\nmso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';\nfont-size:12.0000pt;\n}\n\nspan.msoIns{\nmso-style-type:export-only;\nmso-style-name:\"\";\ntext-decoration:underline;\ntext-underline:single;\ncolor:blue;\n}\n\nspan.msoDel{\nmso-style-type:export-only;\nmso-style-name:\"\";\ntext-decoration:line-through;\ncolor:red;\n}\n@page{mso-page-border-surround-header:no;\n\tmso-page-border-surround-footer:no;}@page Section0{\nmargin-top:72.0000pt;\nmargin-bottom:72.0000pt;\nmargin-left:90.0000pt;\nmargin-right:90.0000pt;\nsize:595.3000pt 841.9000pt;\nlayout-grid:15.6000pt;\n}\ndiv.Section0{page:Section0;}</style><style>\n@font-face{\nfont-family:\"Times New Roman\";\n}\n\n@font-face{\nfont-family:\"宋体\";\n}\n\n@font-face{\nfont-family:\"Calibri\";\n}\n\np.MsoNormal{\nmso-style-name:正文;\nmso-style-parent:\"\";\nmargin:0pt;\nmargin-bottom:.0001pt;\nmso-pagination:none;\ntext-align:justify;\ntext-justify:inter-ideograph;\nfont-family:Calibri;\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;\nmso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';\nfont-size:10.5000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\n}\n\nspan.10{\nfont-family:Calibri;\n}\n\nspan.15{\nfont-family:Calibri;\nfont-weight:bold;\n}\n\np.p{\nmso-style-name:\"普通\\(网站\\)\";\nmso-margin-top-alt:auto;\nmso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nmso-pagination:none;\ntext-align:left;\nfont-family:Calibri;\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;\nmso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';\nfont-size:12.0000pt;\n}\n\nspan.msoIns{\nmso-style-type:export-only;\nmso-style-name:\"\";\ntext-decoration:underline;\ntext-underline:single;\ncolor:blue;\n}\n\nspan.msoDel{\nmso-style-type:export-only;\nmso-style-name:\"\";\ntext-decoration:line-through;\ncolor:red;\n}\n@page{mso-page-border-surround-header:no;\n\tmso-page-border-surround-footer:no;}@page Section0{\nmargin-top:72.0000pt;\nmargin-bottom:72.0000pt;\nmargin-left:90.0000pt;\nmargin-right:90.0000pt;\nsize:595.3000pt 841.9000pt;\nlayout-grid:15.6000pt;\n}\ndiv.Section0{page:Section0;}</style>\n                ",
